\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Before he could recover, Sarah kicked the weapon. It skittered across the elevator floor and came to rest against the back wall. She snatched it up, gripping it properly now\'97point out, steady in her hand.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Halo straightened, his injured knee barely holding him upright. His eyes tracked the weapon, now in her possession. She stood balanced on the balls of her feet, the Point of Order held low and ready. He could see in her stance that she knew how to use it. If he gave her an excuse, she would strike.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Halo heard a bing and the doors began to open. He turned to make an escape.\
