\cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah watched Halo lurch out of the lift, then fall straight back in, his centre of gravity moving faster than his feet could compensate. He stumbled backward, arms windmilling.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
