<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah released the handle as if it had burned her. Halo staggered forward one step, two. The hollow blade protruded from his back just below his rib cage. Blood began to well around the entry point, then to flow\'97first in rivulets, then in a pulsing stream that soaked through his waiter\'92s uniform and spattered onto the floor.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>And onto Sarah. Hot blood sprayed across her belly, her dress, her hands. She looked down at herself, at Halo\'92s blood covering her like accusation.\
